{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"I appreciate it. I figured that if neither of those locations work, than I could simply ask about the town itself.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:17:59.848000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744092513748647969","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper nods, “that is smart. Also the masons have an artifact that may help us as well. It can create a magic circle that can protect us as we fight. I’ll ask them to use it for the fight.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:18:49.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744092721630674984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"Good, we will need to prepare as much as we can.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:19:35.643000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744092915541999656","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"For the Hallow ritual... the island is still quite dangerous... as I have said before, I will need people to protect me. Once I start it, I need to see it finished, no interruptions.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:21:11.237000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744093316492296255","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"Not even to eat or sleep..\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:21:20.832000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744093356736381018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“I understand. I will gather all the people I can to assist us in this. Just tell us when you start the hallow spell and we will be there.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:22:20.485000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744093606939459624","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"There is another thing... those who come with will need to know\" She looks at her scars the mist endlessly pouring out of them. \"When the Elder Bear took me, it left it's mark on me.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:24:05.241000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744094046317838428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper listens respectfully","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:25:07.698000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744094308281614366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"These scars, the mist..\" she looks a little nervous to say this, \"I am marked to be hunted by it, as food. So other creatures know this.. they could try to kill me for the Elder Bear..\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:25:57.793000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-15T07:26:14.687000Z","id":"744094518395273257","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper nods, “I’ve been marked as well my friend. Though by something different, I understand the pain and suffering it can cause. I swear I will be there to protect you.” He says with a solid nod and a smile","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:27:10.612000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744094823820034060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"Thank you Copper.\" She looks a mixture of relived and grateful. \"I'm sorry that I misjudged you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:30:16.416000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744095603138494496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper let’s out a small laugh, “no apologies needed my friend. I understand these are trying times. Everyone is questioning each other. It is only fair that people are skeptical of me as well”","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:31:30.750000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744095914917888072","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"You are a good friend, I think me being left homeless for about a week left me sore when it came to the leadership around here..\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:34:12.805000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744096594625822781","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“Why did you not tell me you were homeless? You could have easily spent slept in my home. There is plenty of space in there, more than I need.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:35:49.612000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744097000663941161","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"My home is outside of the town.\" She points to a grove of trees in the outskirts, \"I ended up staying with others so don't worry please. I stayed with Cato about three days, Sir Rigatony for one, and at the Chateau the other. I was taken care of.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:38:01.063000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-15T07:38:08.482000Z","id":"744097552009265152","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper nods, “I am happy to hear that you were well taken care of.” He looks to her, “if you ever need anything, do not hesitate to ask me. And I will do everything in my power to assist you.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:40:58.300000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744098295395254292","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Lilia gives Copper a warm smile \"You are too good a person, I think.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:41:44.236000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744098488064802886","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper laughs, “I try to treat everyone as good as I can. I feel, that if I can help someone smile even a little, then they will do that for someone else in kind. Who will then help the next person, and the next person, and the next.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:43:49.922000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744099015229964399","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"She pauses \"You said you marked by something as well. May I ask what?\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:46:43.028000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744099741289152593","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Coppers face tightens a little, he lets out sigh, “I’ve been marked by the thing we are trying destroy.“ he looks to her; “The Hunger has Marked me.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:48:45.990000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744100257029423225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Lilia looks like she regrets asking a little","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:52:00.131000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744101071315795978","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"What does it mean to be marked by it?\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:54:08.977000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744101611734827099","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“In all honesty, I am not certain. However, considering most of the danger we faced has been something created by it, I don’t imagine it’ll be any good.” He looks up to the stars, “I’ve heard whispers. Voices in my head, telling me things. That’s how I knew when the hunger was coming.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:56:16.805000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744102147884580865","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“In truth, I’ve been afraid to face it. To look into it fully. I know I should be, but I fear what will happen to me once I know more about it.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T07:57:04.077000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744102346157457470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Lilia puts a hand on his arm \"I could help you if you want? Protection from evil could work..\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:00:21.737000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744103175203848192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"You don't have to do it alone.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:01:12.761000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744103389213884417","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper looks to her, “I- Id genuinely appreciate that. If you think it could work, I’m willing to give it a try.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:02:02.760000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744103598925021194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"I don't know much about what we are facing..saying it's name gives it power, it can consume gods... I don't know what would happen if we try to examine the mark it gave you further... If you want to try, I will help you, if not I also think it is a safe choice.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:04:42.549000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744104269128400926","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“To defeat our enemy, we must first know our enemy. It would make sense to investigate any and all information we can on it. It may show us a weakness we hadn’t known about before. If there are any negative consequences, I will accept full responsibility for them.” He pauses a moment, “I trust you.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:06:43.635000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744104777000026152","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"She nods, \"I worry you will get hurt in the process. If we can, we should wait till I've performed Hallow.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:10:53.770000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744105826142388277","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper nods “alright, if you think that that is best.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:11:38.852000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744106015229870120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"That space will be safe. I don't know what will happen.\" She says simply","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:13:17.664000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744106429677436970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“Whatever happens, I will accept it. So long as it will help us all survive, I am ready.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:16:56.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744107348762820709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Lilia shakes her head and gives a small laugh \"Too many are ready to risk it all to protect others. It feels like no one wants to fight for their chance to live. It is honorable to risk yourself for others but its also honorable to live for others.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:21:37.846000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744108527592931338","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"This cracks a smile from copper, “you are right. My apologies. It seems I need to think harder on what I want for my future.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:22:31.994000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744108754706104410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"You are someone I would like to see alive after all of this. Please don't throw it away so willingly.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T08:23:54.395000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744109100320686080","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
